Package: mgcvST
Title: SPDE Smoothing and RKHS Covariance Tests for Spatial Features
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person(given = "Yihe", family = "Yang",
    email = "yxy1234@case.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides topology-aware boundary learning and finite-element mesh
    generation, a proper Matern stochastic partial differential equation
    smooth registered with 'mgcv', and signed reproducing-kernel Hilbert space
    covariance score tests for spatial and spatiotemporal feature pairs. The
    numerical core uses final IRLS working models, compact residual-precision
    operators, low-rank score summaries, and signed quadratic-form calibration
    without constructing observation-level residual projection matrices.
